  <p class="kicker">FAQ</p><h2>Your questions, answered</h2><div class="gold-rule"></div>
  <div class="faq-item"><h3>Wood-fired or electric?</h3><p>Both are available. Wood-burning stoves are hand-matched to the room volume; electric heaters suit sites where flues are impractical.</p></div><div class="faq-item"><h3>Does an outdoor sauna need planning permission?</h3><p>Smaller cave saunas often fall within permitted development. Where consent is needed we handle it end to end — see the planning guide.</p></div><div class="faq-item"><h3>What maintenance does it need?</h3><p>Very little. The concrete vault does not rot, warp or need retreating like timber saunas; interior woodwork needs only the care of any quality sauna.</p></div>
  <p style="margin-top:18px;font-size:14.5px">More questions? <a href="/faq/" style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">See the full FAQ</a>.</p>
